{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Tim: Hey John, this week's been really busy for me. Assignments and exams are overwhelming. I'm not giving up though! I'm trying to find a way to juggle studying with my fantasy reading hobby. How have you been?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-43/session_9-d36140ca08cf4fd1cf20b5e2", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:35:13.151304+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "d36140ca08cf4fd1cf20b5e2", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "d36140ca08cf4fd1cf20b5e2", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Hey Tim! I know the stress of exams and homework, but you got this! I'm doing OK, cheers for asking. Last week I visited home and caught up with my family and old friends. We had a great time talking about our childhood - it reminds me of the good ol' times!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-43/session_9-d84c69299a120e12af8811b2", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:35:13.177597+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "d84c69299a120e12af8811b2", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "d84c69299a120e12af8811b2", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Tim: Thanks for the pic! That group looks like a great squad. How long did you all play together?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-43/session_9-8c1f22a193576d31511d11a0", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:35:13.201958+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "8c1f22a193576d31511d11a0", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "8c1f22a193576d31511d11a0", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: We were teammates for four years in high school, so we've played together for quite some time. Have you ever been part of a sports team?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-43/session_9-4059fbb7b642304159efddf2", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:35:13.224556+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "4059fbb7b642304159efddf2", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "4059fbb7b642304159efddf2", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Tim: Nope, never been on a sports team. I'm more into reading and fantasy novels. I love sinking into different magical worlds. It's one of the reasons I love traveling to new places, to experience a different kind of magic."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-43/session_9-37ce8d6340f9d872de163f8c", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:35:13.251366+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "37ce8d6340f9d872de163f8c", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "37ce8d6340f9d872de163f8c", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Wow, Tim, that's an awesome book collection! It's cool to escape to different worlds with a hobby. By the way, I love discovering new cities - check out this pic from one of my trips to New York City!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-43/session_9-a068e51d09176371c6c55940", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:35:13.275554+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "a068e51d09176371c6c55940", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "a068e51d09176371c6c55940", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Tim: Wow! That skyline looks amazing - I've been wanting to visit NYC. How was it?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-43/session_9-e9bb4d111ef1b33797bfeb43", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:35:13.294736+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "e9bb4d111ef1b33797bfeb43", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "e9bb4d111ef1b33797bfeb43", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Thanks! It was amazing. Everywhere you go there's something new and exciting. Exploring the city and trying all the restaurants was awesome. It's a must-visit!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-43/session_9-74d7bee2eb016114d9bb6e5f", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:35:13.310756+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "74d7bee2eb016114d9bb6e5f", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "74d7bee2eb016114d9bb6e5f", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Tim: Adding NYC to my travel list, sounds like a great adventure! I heard there's so much to explore and try out. Can't wait to visit!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-43/session_9-d32efa7af79a96ab9c76f8eb", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:35:13.336560+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "d32efa7af79a96ab9c76f8eb", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "d32efa7af79a96ab9c76f8eb", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Trust me, NYC is amazing! It's got so much to check out - the culture, food - you won't regret it. It's an adventure you'll never forget!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-43/session_9-b2bb1251c1f92a0f3b52cf42", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:35:13.362879+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "b2bb1251c1f92a0f3b52cf42", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "b2bb1251c1f92a0f3b52cf42", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Tim: Woohoo! Sounds like a fun place with lots of potential. Can't wait to experience it for myself!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-43/session_9-ef584b1d442f989e024b75ce", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:35:13.377419+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "ef584b1d442f989e024b75ce", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "ef584b1d442f989e024b75ce", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Awesome! Can't wait to hear when you are going. Let me know and I'm sure I can help you out."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-43/session_9-453b85e23f4c829689fd8363", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:35:13.408194+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "453b85e23f4c829689fd8363", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "453b85e23f4c829689fd8363", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Tim: Yep, I'll let you know! Thanks for being so helpful."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-43/session_9-6d93ee68667e7e68eda6ac13", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:35:13.434070+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "6d93ee68667e7e68eda6ac13", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "6d93ee68667e7e68eda6ac13", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Sure thing! Any time you need help, don't hesitate to reach out."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-43/session_9-91cba083fc01fd2c4b766307", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:35:13.461595+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "91cba083fc01fd2c4b766307", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "91cba083fc01fd2c4b766307", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Tim: Thanks! Your support means a lot to me. Bye!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-43/session_9-ceb6114b3860273364c2b39c", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T14:35:13.478884+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "ceb6114b3860273364c2b39c", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "ceb6114b3860273364c2b39c", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
